WEBVTT

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:37.200
What is this?

00:00:37.200 --> 00:00:41.340
Souls that have learned what it means to be loved

00:00:41.340 --> 00:00:44.860
will not help bring me back to life.

00:00:49.980 --> 00:00:55.750
I need souls that are starved for love.

00:00:55.750 --> 00:00:58.690
But, where can we find such people?

00:00:58.690 --> 00:01:02.210
There is one, she who taught Wolyafa of love.

00:01:04.190 --> 00:01:07.260
Her soul is uncertain.

00:01:07.260 --> 00:01:13.900
The slightest persuasion of her heart will make her a fine vessel for me.

00:01:15.340 --> 00:01:17.770
<i>We are the stars</i>

00:01:17.770 --> 00:01:21.740
<i>We dash across the skies</i>

00:01:21.740 --> 00:01:24.250
<i>You are my star</i>

00:01:24.250 --> 00:01:28.750
<i>A priceless love</i>

00:01:28.750 --> 00:01:34.560
<i>El Dorado,</i> <i>rising up above the dust clouds</i>

00:01:34.560 --> 00:01:38.490
<i>We are journey to the stars</i>

00:01:42.530 --> 00:01:46.600
<i>The dream I saw before I awoke</i>

00:01:46.600 --> 00:01:53.910
<i>Will surely come true, so never forget it</i>

00:01:55.380 --> 00:01:59.450
<i>Searching for a sliver in time passing by</i>

00:01:59.450 --> 00:02:06.580
<i>Where I belong, those days are over now</i>

00:02:08.090 --> 00:02:12.060
<i>Silhouettes outlining the shapes of clouds</i>

00:02:12.060 --> 00:02:14.500
<i>Farther and farther</i>

00:02:14.500 --> 00:02:21.440
<i>I want to keep looking for</i> <i>the promised land I saw in my dreams</i>

00:02:21.440 --> 00:02:23.710
<i>We are the stars</i>

00:02:23.710 --> 00:02:27.780
<i>Like a shining arrow</i>

00:02:27.780 --> 00:02:30.280
<i>You are my star</i>

00:02:30.280 --> 00:02:34.820
<i>Unfailing strength</i>

00:02:34.820 --> 00:02:40.620
<i>The panorama that spreads before us,</i> <i>beyond the darkness</i>

00:02:40.620 --> 00:02:43.520
<i>We are journey to the stars</i>

00:02:47.060 --> 00:02:50.790
Poring... Poring... Poring!

00:02:55.200 --> 00:02:56.540
Poring.

00:03:17.360 --> 00:03:20.990
The Dark Lord will be pleased.

00:03:29.070 --> 00:03:32.010
Huh? What?

00:03:32.010 --> 00:03:36.510
What do you mean there's no ship to the Faros Lighthouse?

00:03:36.510 --> 00:03:42.750
Just that. Today's ship already left.

00:03:42.750 --> 00:03:48.310
The next ship is... let's see... tomorrow afternoon at the earliest.

00:03:49.690 --> 00:03:52.760
I want to get to Comodo as soon as possible!

00:03:52.760 --> 00:03:55.900
I want to confirm what she told me.

00:03:55.900 --> 00:03:57.670
Go to Comodo.

00:03:57.670 --> 00:04:01.160
You might find the answer you're looking for there.

00:04:02.270 --> 00:04:04.470
Don't get so upset.

00:04:04.470 --> 00:04:08.310
If the ship's gone, we can stay at an inn.

00:04:08.310 --> 00:04:10.110
Right, Iruga?

00:04:11.410 --> 00:04:16.750
Geez! Takius-<i>san</i> up and disappears...

00:04:16.750 --> 00:04:18.980
Nothing but bad things have been happening.

00:04:20.360 --> 00:04:22.690
There were good things, too...

00:04:24.830 --> 00:04:28.930
So, does this mean we're free until dinnertime?

00:04:28.930 --> 00:04:31.270
Well, I suppose so...

00:04:31.270 --> 00:04:34.940
Then, Ma-<i>chan</i> has someplace to go.

00:04:34.940 --> 00:04:35.870
See you!

00:04:35.870 --> 00:04:36.940
Let's go, Poi-Poi.

00:04:36.940 --> 00:04:38.710
Poring.

00:04:38.710 --> 00:04:40.980
What's with her?

00:04:40.980 --> 00:04:42.670
This isn't a school excursion, you know!

00:04:49.620 --> 00:04:51.850
Poring.

00:04:53.890 --> 00:04:55.720
Alice-<i>chan</i>?

00:04:58.360 --> 00:05:01.300
Do you live here?

00:05:03.530 --> 00:05:05.100
I see...

00:05:05.100 --> 00:05:08.970
There were reports of monsters going in and out of this warehouse,

00:05:08.970 --> 00:05:11.970
so I was on patrol.

00:05:11.970 --> 00:05:14.140
Do you know anything about it?

00:05:15.280 --> 00:05:18.650
Ma-<i>chan</i> don't know anything!

00:05:18.650 --> 00:05:20.640
P-Poring.

00:05:37.370 --> 00:05:39.330
Poring.

00:05:42.600 --> 00:05:46.670
Where could Alice have gone?

00:06:06.460 --> 00:06:07.950
Poring!

00:06:13.840 --> 00:06:15.460
Alice-<i>chan</i>!

00:06:17.070 --> 00:06:18.310
Where've you been?

00:06:18.310 --> 00:06:20.300
I've been looking for you!

00:06:34.960 --> 00:06:36.650
Nothing...

00:06:42.500 --> 00:06:43.990
Poring?

00:06:46.370 --> 00:06:47.840
Nothing...

00:06:49.440 --> 00:06:51.940
Let's play, Alice-<i>chan</i>!

00:06:51.940 --> 00:06:53.000
Poring.

00:07:04.150 --> 00:07:08.280
Alice-<i>chan</i>... get on...

00:07:30.610 --> 00:07:34.420
I used to really hate this town...

00:07:34.420 --> 00:07:37.050
But now, I love it!

00:07:37.050 --> 00:07:42.650
Thanks to this town,
I met you, Alice-<i>chan.</i>

00:07:51.970 --> 00:07:54.070
What's the matter?

00:07:54.070 --> 00:07:56.000
I'm waiting for my Papa.

00:07:57.370 --> 00:07:58.410
Papa?

00:07:58.410 --> 00:08:00.780
Yes. My Papa's a sailor.

00:08:00.780 --> 00:08:04.950
I always wait here until he comes back.

00:08:04.950 --> 00:08:06.580
When's he coming back?

00:08:06.580 --> 00:08:09.180
When the sun sets in the west.

00:08:09.180 --> 00:08:10.950
When it sets?

00:08:16.060 --> 00:08:21.160
Then, would you like to play with us until your father gets back?

00:08:21.160 --> 00:08:23.000
Can I?

00:08:23.000 --> 00:08:25.830
Sure. Let's play together!

00:08:25.830 --> 00:08:26.960
Okay!

00:08:47.790 --> 00:08:49.980
Slow down!

00:08:56.460 --> 00:08:58.330
It's Papa's ship!

00:09:03.570 --> 00:09:06.810
Papa's back, so I have to go home.

00:09:06.810 --> 00:09:08.710
Let's play again tomorrow.

00:09:08.710 --> 00:09:09.910
Not just tomorrow-

00:09:09.910 --> 00:09:14.220
I'll play with you every time
I come to this town.

00:09:14.220 --> 00:09:15.650
Really?

00:09:15.650 --> 00:09:16.950
Sure.

00:09:20.660 --> 00:09:22.620
Then, see you tomorrow!

00:09:22.620 --> 00:09:25.690
Thank you, both of you.

00:09:25.690 --> 00:09:27.290
See you again!

00:09:28.500 --> 00:09:31.130
Oh... Alice-<i>chan</i>?

00:09:32.400 --> 00:09:34.960
Are you going home already, too?

00:09:36.140 --> 00:09:39.170
Come with me.

00:09:39.170 --> 00:09:41.480
There are guards around that warehouse,

00:09:41.480 --> 00:09:44.070
so why don't you travel with us?

00:09:45.110 --> 00:09:47.310
Poring.

00:09:50.620 --> 00:09:53.650
Will you? Really?

00:09:57.530 --> 00:09:58.860
Then we'll be together.

00:09:58.860 --> 00:10:02.700
You and Ma-<i>chan</i> will always be together.

00:10:02.700 --> 00:10:06.330
Come with me.
I'll introduce you to everybody.

00:10:08.440 --> 00:10:11.570
My... things...

00:10:11.570 --> 00:10:17.040
Oh, that's right.
You need to get your things.

00:10:17.040 --> 00:10:19.510
Okay. Let's meet tomorrow morning.

00:10:19.510 --> 00:10:20.670
Right here.

00:10:28.820 --> 00:10:30.860
What's the matter with this meat?!

00:10:30.860 --> 00:10:33.390
Don't take it out on the food.

00:10:33.390 --> 00:10:34.760
Get off my case!

00:10:34.760 --> 00:10:37.870
You're the cause of all this, Yuufa!

00:10:37.870 --> 00:10:40.640
We missed the ship because you walked too slowly!

00:10:40.640 --> 00:10:42.300
That's not...

00:10:42.300 --> 00:10:44.170
Cut it out!

00:10:44.170 --> 00:10:47.340
Men shouldn't throw tantrums.

00:10:47.340 --> 00:10:49.370
I'm not throwing a tantrum!

00:10:53.410 --> 00:10:55.350
I'm going to call it a night.

00:10:55.350 --> 00:10:59.220
Good idea. We walked all the way from Fayon.

00:10:59.220 --> 00:11:01.050
Let's do that.

00:11:06.230 --> 00:11:09.160
Roan, I...

00:11:10.430 --> 00:11:13.370
Sorry I'm late again!

00:11:13.370 --> 00:11:15.240
Poring.

00:11:15.240 --> 00:11:17.770
Huh? Is something the matter?

00:11:17.770 --> 00:11:20.800
No, it's nothing...

00:11:25.510 --> 00:11:27.680
Poring?

00:12:44.890 --> 00:12:46.760
Damn!

00:12:46.760 --> 00:12:48.230
Heal!

00:12:50.500 --> 00:12:52.520
Roan!

00:12:53.330 --> 00:12:56.570
Yuufa! Give me strength!

00:12:56.570 --> 00:13:01.030
Blessing Aspersio Gloria!

00:13:04.450 --> 00:13:05.640
Here I come!

00:13:13.020 --> 00:13:16.260
Thank you, Yuufa.

00:13:16.260 --> 00:13:18.990
I was able to win thanks to you.

00:13:21.030 --> 00:13:23.360
Your support is the best.

00:13:23.360 --> 00:13:25.770
I need you.

00:13:25.770 --> 00:13:27.430
Roan!

00:13:27.430 --> 00:13:28.990
Yuufa!

00:13:35.340 --> 00:13:37.000
That hurt...

00:13:43.220 --> 00:13:45.120
Stupid Roan!

00:13:47.390 --> 00:13:49.920
Maaya-<i>chan</i>?

00:13:49.920 --> 00:13:53.020
Where could she be headed so early in the morning?

00:14:09.180 --> 00:14:12.980
Alice-<i>chan</i> isn't here yet?

00:14:22.890 --> 00:14:23.980
Ouch!

00:14:32.800 --> 00:14:34.670
What's going on?!

00:14:48.280 --> 00:14:50.220
Monsters!

00:14:50.220 --> 00:14:51.390
Monsters?!

00:14:51.390 --> 00:14:53.550
An evil Druid, too!

00:14:53.550 --> 00:14:56.020
What the hell is happening?!

00:14:59.660 --> 00:15:01.630
Wait, Roan!

00:15:05.830 --> 00:15:08.900
You don't have to go...
Don't force yourself.

00:15:08.900 --> 00:15:10.570
I'll be fine.

00:15:10.570 --> 00:15:14.630
Your life burns within me.

00:15:19.850 --> 00:15:21.440
Shield...

00:15:22.850 --> 00:15:24.320
...Boomerang!

00:15:31.060 --> 00:15:32.590
Roan!

00:15:32.590 --> 00:15:34.660
How many are there, anyway?!

00:15:34.660 --> 00:15:38.290
I sure hope they haven't spread throughout the town!

00:15:40.700 --> 00:15:42.500
That's exactly right.

00:15:42.500 --> 00:15:46.940
Right now, the monsters have Alberta covered.

00:15:46.940 --> 00:15:52.380
Rushing everything isn't always the best plan, you know, Keough.

00:15:52.380 --> 00:15:55.020
How about it?

00:15:55.020 --> 00:15:57.790
Isn't this a wonderful sight?

00:15:57.790 --> 00:16:02.280
Cringe with fright, you humans!

00:16:04.990 --> 00:16:07.030
They're nothin', you idiot!

00:16:07.030 --> 00:16:07.930
What?

00:16:07.930 --> 00:16:10.630
Arrow Shower!

00:16:14.770 --> 00:16:16.240
Sonic...

00:16:17.670 --> 00:16:18.930
...Blow.

00:16:28.650 --> 00:16:30.050
Iruga-<i>san</i>!

00:16:30.050 --> 00:16:31.250
Judia-<i>san</i>!

00:16:31.250 --> 00:16:34.890
Looks like you have your hands full!

00:16:34.890 --> 00:16:36.090
Let's put them down.

00:16:36.090 --> 00:16:37.650
Okay!

00:16:38.660 --> 00:16:40.190
Wait, Roan.

00:16:40.190 --> 00:16:41.530
Blessi...

00:16:44.000 --> 00:16:45.660
Shield Boomerang!

00:16:50.600 --> 00:16:54.310
Yuufa! If you're going to slow us down, stand back!

00:16:54.310 --> 00:16:55.510
But I...

00:16:57.180 --> 00:17:00.780
Those pesky bugs...

00:17:00.780 --> 00:17:02.610
Come on out!

00:17:06.150 --> 00:17:08.620
What was that explosion just now?!

00:17:17.730 --> 00:17:21.400
Wh-What is that monster?

00:17:21.400 --> 00:17:24.300
I've never seen a monster like it!

00:17:33.650 --> 00:17:35.980
Alice-<i>chan</i> sure is late...

00:17:35.980 --> 00:17:37.280
Poring.

00:17:37.280 --> 00:17:38.980
Holy Light!

00:17:39.990 --> 00:17:42.320
Arrow Shower!

00:17:45.360 --> 00:17:46.620
Take that!

00:17:51.170 --> 00:17:53.500
It's still coming!

00:17:53.500 --> 00:17:54.600
Iruga?!

00:17:54.600 --> 00:17:57.660
Sonic Blow!

00:17:59.240 --> 00:18:01.400
Iruga, stand clear!

00:18:02.410 --> 00:18:03.780
Grand...

00:18:05.250 --> 00:18:06.440
...Cross!

00:18:17.120 --> 00:18:18.290
Did I kill it?

00:18:21.700 --> 00:18:24.630
What?! It's still moving!

00:18:32.540 --> 00:18:34.370
What just happened?

00:18:34.370 --> 00:18:36.040
It won't give up!

00:18:36.040 --> 00:18:38.640
Wait! Something's strange.

00:18:43.520 --> 00:18:45.490
Where's it going?

00:18:50.660 --> 00:18:54.320
I see... this is going to be interesting.

00:18:59.930 --> 00:19:01.930
Big Sis!

00:19:05.310 --> 00:19:08.610
Big Sis! Alberta is...

00:19:11.710 --> 00:19:13.080
What's that?

00:19:13.080 --> 00:19:15.820
What's going on? Alberta is...

00:19:15.820 --> 00:19:17.940
The town of Alberta is...

00:19:21.690 --> 00:19:22.620
Look out!

00:19:36.040 --> 00:19:37.600
Are you okay?

00:19:37.600 --> 00:19:39.630
You did this, didn't you?!

00:19:40.810 --> 00:19:44.640
You... You did this to Alberta!

00:19:52.590 --> 00:19:53.490
I'll teach you to...

00:19:53.490 --> 00:19:55.660
Poring! Poring!

00:19:55.660 --> 00:19:57.120
What?

00:19:57.120 --> 00:19:58.990
Out of my way, Poi-Poi!

00:20:00.990 --> 00:20:02.800
The warehouse...

00:20:02.800 --> 00:20:05.030
My home!

00:20:05.030 --> 00:20:06.520
Why did this happen?

00:20:07.530 --> 00:20:14.000
How dare you destroy the town where
Alice-<i>chan</i> and I have such fond memories!

00:20:16.280 --> 00:20:18.580
Poring! Poring!

00:20:18.580 --> 00:20:20.670
How could you!

00:20:21.980 --> 00:20:25.680
How could you?! How could you?!

00:20:29.220 --> 00:20:30.350
Poring!

00:20:39.130 --> 00:20:42.690
Grand Cross!

00:20:47.540 --> 00:20:49.030
Is it over?

00:20:56.850 --> 00:20:59.720
I wonder what happened to Alice-<i>chan</i>?

00:21:36.920 --> 00:21:39.020
Poring... Poring!

00:21:59.250 --> 00:22:01.650
Poring!

00:22:02.920 --> 00:22:04.980
Alice-<i>chan</i>!

00:22:34.920 --> 00:22:44.910
<i>Unable to even find a way</i> <i>to regain the strength we lost</i>

00:22:45.890 --> 00:22:54.000
<i>Here we are, beneath this vast sky</i>

00:22:54.000 --> 00:22:58.840
<i>The shining cradle of green</i>

00:22:58.840 --> 00:23:03.710
<i>Is a merry-go-round that</i> <i>will never stop turning</i>

00:23:03.710 --> 00:23:08.480
<i>Greater than any jewel</i> <i>in this world</i>

00:23:08.480 --> 00:23:12.820
<i>It is a precious treasure</i>

00:23:12.820 --> 00:23:22.820
<i>The endless journey leads</i> <i>to our tomorrow</i>

00:23:31.470 --> 00:23:32.570
<i>This is Sorin.</i>

00:23:32.570 --> 00:23:36.340
<i>Maaya's heart is in tatters after</i> <i>learning she had killed Alice.</i>

00:23:36.340 --> 00:23:38.880
<i>Then Jildas adds insult to injury.</i>

00:23:38.880 --> 00:23:41.520
<i>Next time,</i> "It's Okay."

00:23:41.520 --> 00:23:44.350
<i>Don't say things like that, Maaya-chan.</i>
